elper in `marker.go`, plus a body filter that defuses mentions and raw HTML outside code.\n- **Starter scanners:**\n  - docs: `code()` in `docscan.go` is strengthened to the same rule.\n  - error-codes: a new `code` helper in `errcodes.jq`.\n  - cve: `safetxt` in `merge.jq` now also covers `@`, and the title uses it.\n- **Proposal:** a \"Scanner text is untrusted\" paragraph in the Scanners section of `docs/proposal.md`.\n- **Tests:** a title table test, a hostile detail-block test, and a hostile-path table test for each starter scanner.\n\n**Size and risk:** size L (roughly 350–500 changed lines, mostly tests), risk medium. Titles of existing issues change the next time they are edited, but fingerprints don't depend on titles, so dedupe is unaffected.\n\nTwo things the maintainers should know:\n- `.ard/scanners/cve/` is a protected path, so the plan doesn't edit it. Its copy of `merge.jq` will differ from the starter copy under `internal/roles` until a maintainer applies the same change by hand.\n- The docs scanner is built standalone and can't import the pipeline package, so its helper is a second copy of the same rule.","ttft_ms":1290,"type":"result","duration_ms":47062,"uuid":"ccb3c669-e4d3-4819-bf9a-7de9f1b8f1b8","ttft_stream_ms":700,"time_to_request_ms":25,"first_content_frame_ms":700,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":18,"outputTokens":6028,"cacheReadInputTokens":141736,"cacheCreationInputTokens":19942,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.15425760000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":875,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":19942,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
